WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Harsh Static, Tinnitus Tone, and Heavy Industrial Guitar Riff Intro]

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Sitting in the lecture hall

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The fortress we all built

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Mark and Hannah are a wall

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
To block the noise and guilt

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
I'm trying just to focus

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
On the professor's words

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000
When something's wrong, a different static

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000
A sound I've never heard

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.000
A sudden crushing pressure

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000
A heavy, awful weight

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.000
A fire climbing up my jaw, I've left it all too late

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.000
I'm sweating cold, I cannot breathe, I grab for Aubrie's hand

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.000
This isn't panic, this is real, it's more than I can stand!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.000
FRIDAY! 9:32!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
The system is in crash!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
My mother's legacy!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.000
My body's turned to ash!

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.000
A critical STEMI! A nineteen-year-old!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.000
This is the real attack!

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:24.000
My heart is failing! My heart is failing!

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.000
I see the terror in Mark's eyes

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
He's seen this all before

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:40.000
He's screaming at the professor

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.000
He's running for the door

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.000
And Zoe's on the phone, urgent medical

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:54.000
And Aubrie's crying, "I'm here, I'm here"

00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:00.000
The gurney's here, the stair chair's out, the lights are flashing red

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:06.000
They're cutting off my T-shirt, wires all around my head

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:12.000
"Chew these aspirins, son, we're running hot"

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.000
This is the end of everything, the only chance I've got!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.000
FRIDAY! 9:32!

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:30.000
The system is in crash!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.000
My mother's legacy!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:40.000
My body's turned to ash!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:45.000
A critical STEMI! A nineteen-year-old!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.000
This is the real attack!

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:54.000
My heart is failing! My heart is failing!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:03.000
"Aubrie... New River Valley... My chair..."

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:26.480
[Heavy Industrial & Cardiac Monitor Flatline Outro]
